From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] fix: use update-after-bind UAV limits for feature level
 11_1
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Problem: the maximum feature level was 11_0. D3D12CreateDevice(FL 12_0)
returned E_INVALIDARG, so games requesting 12_0 failed or took their FL 11
fallback (V2).

Root cause: the FL 11_1 check required maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers/
Images >= 64; MoltenVK reports Metal's 31 discrete buffer slots. vkd3d never
binds UAVs through per-stage slots: descriptor tables go through bindless
update-after-bind heaps (~1M on argument buffers), which is also why it
already reports resource binding tier 3.

Fix: compare the larger of the plain and update-after-bind limits.

Verified by: maximum feature level 12_0 (12_1 needs ROVs and conservative
rasterization, not available on Metal); the demo at FL 12_0 shows its normal
timeline with no errors; sweep8: 0 regressions (N§25). FL 11_1 also needs
OutputMergerLogicOp, which MoltenVK reports when built with
MVK_USE_METAL_PRIVATE_API=1.

Off switch: none.
---
 libs/vkd3d/device.c | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/device.c b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
index 0fc1b06..3daa90b 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/device.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
@@ -9712,9 +9712,14 @@ static void d3d12_device_caps_init_feature_level(struct d3d12_device *device)
 
     caps->max_feature_level = D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_11_0;
 
+    /* UAVs reach shaders through the bindless descriptor heaps (update-after-bind), never through
+     * per-stage descriptor slots, so check the limits of that path. On MoltenVK the plain per-stage
+     * buffer limit is Metal's 31 discrete slots while argument buffers allow ~1M. */
     if (caps->options.OutputMergerLogicOp && features->vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics &&
-            vk_info->device_limits.maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers >= D3D12_UAV_SLOT_COUNT &&
-            vk_info->device_limits.maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages >= D3D12_UAV_SLOT_COUNT)
+            max(vk_info->device_limits.maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers,
+                device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.maxPerStageDescriptorUpdateAfterBindStorageBuffers) >= D3D12_UAV_SLOT_COUNT &&
+            max(vk_info->device_limits.maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages,
+                device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.maxPerStageDescriptorUpdateAfterBindStorageImages) >= D3D12_UAV_SLOT_COUNT)
         caps->max_feature_level = D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_11_1;
 
     if (caps->max_feature_level >= D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_11_1 &&
